(
/*
Direction: input GWDM 2.2 -> output GWDM 2.3 (the path is output-first).

GWDM 2.3 only adds optional fields (population, linkage.datasetLinkage.waveOf,
required.recordType, crocod), so every GWDM 2.2 document is already a valid
GWDM 2.3 document. Everything that reaches GWDM 2.2 is a dataset, so
recordType is set to "dataset" explicitly rather than left to the schema
default.

This pair exists so HDRUK 4.1.0 and CRUK, which reach GWDM 2.2, can chain on to
GWDM 2.3.
*/
input ~> |$| {
  "required": required ~> |$| { "recordType": "dataset" }|
}|
)
